/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (PixCrawler is an automated, intelligent platform for building high-quality image datasets for machine learning, research, and computer-vision applications. It streamlines the entire lifecycle of dataset creation from collecting images across the web, validating metadata, processing and optimizing assets, to storing them efficiently in scalable cloud environments.)
/E (PixCrawler is an automated, intelligent platform for building high-quality image datasets for machine learning, research, and computer-vision applications. It streamlines the entire lifecycle of dataset creation from collecting images across the web, validating metadata, processing and optimizing assets, to storing them efficiently in scalable cloud environments.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
