<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (PixCrawler is built for ML engineers, data scientists, research teams, and organizations that require continuous dataset updates or large-scale automated data ingestion. With its modular pipeline, strong validation strategy, and fault-tolerant architecture, the platform can scale to millions of images while maintaining performance and compliance with retention policies.)
/E (PixCrawler is built for ML engineers, data scientists, research teams, and organizations that require continuous dataset updates or large-scale automated data ingestion. With its modular pipeline, strong validation strategy, and fault-tolerant architecture, the platform can scale to millions of images while maintaining performance and compliance with retention policies.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
